  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Enjoy the Beaches and fun of 30A at 49 Ashley Lane. Custom built home located just a short walk, or bike to the beach, restaurants, and shops. (several bikes are included). The house is located in the upscale community of Lakeside at Blue Mountain Beach. The pool (heated & cooled) is just around the corner from the house. The Blue Mountain public beach access is less than a 10 minute walk and has a parking lot and bathrooms.<br><br>\"Sea Garden\" cottage has an open floor plan with teak hardwood floors, large modern kitchen with seating at the island and dining table. Comfortable den with large TV. Down stairs master bedroom has King bed with TV. Master bath also has a TV to watch while you relax in your freestanding soaking tub. Both upstairs bedrooms have a queen bed with ensuite full bathrooms (tub & shower). Additional twin built-in Bunkbeds in upstairs landing area along with additional queen fold out couch in upstairs bedroom.<br><br>Kick back on the large front porch with swing and additional seating. Bike or walk to shops and restaurants and the beautiful beach. Gas grill provided. Close to Grayton Beach, WaterColor and Seaside.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
